Hello World!

Firecrawl example
-----------------

examples/extract_links.py lists the URLs of a site using Firecrawl's map
endpoint (https://docs.firecrawl.dev/api-reference/endpoint/map):

    pip install -r examples/requirements.txt
    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...      # get a key at https://firecrawl.dev
    python examples/extract_links.py https://example.com --limit 20

Firecrawl docs: https://docs.firecrawl.dev
